a:22:{s:4:"ASIN";s:10:"B0CQ248F4C";s:10:"ParentASIN";s:10:"B0BP14CHH6";s:14:"ItemAttributes";a:10:{s:5:"Brand";s:7:"KiiBoom";s:12:"Manufacturer";s:7:"KiiBoom";s:7:"Binding";s:18:"Personal Computers";s:13:"Product Group";s:17:"Personal Computer";s:7:"Feature";a:5:{i:0;s:499:"【KiiBOOM x Maorbeng Keycaps Set】Step into a world where each keystroke is a symphony of cuteness with the KiiBOOM x Maorbeng Meow Meow Squad Keycaps Set! With compatibility across various keyboard sizes, this Keycaps Set is not just an accessory, but a centerpiece that transforms your keyboard into a delightful menagerie of keyboard. It's a must-have for enthusiasts who want to infuse their workspace with a dash of whimsy and a whisper of comfort, turning the mundane into the extraordinary.";i:1;s:467:"【Ergonomic MAO Profile】The unique MAO profile height introduces a novel typing experience, tailored for ergonomic comfort and aesthetic pleasure. Revel in a palette of soothing pastels, with each keycap featuring an adorable cat motif, from the whimsical expressions of playful kittens to serene and wise feline faces. The attention to detail is evident, as even the 'Enter' key is graced with a lounging cat, inviting you to pause and smile amidst your busy day.";i:2;s:248:"【Dye-Sublimation on PBT Material】KiiBOOM Maorbeng keycaps are constructed from top-tier PBT material using a five-sided dye-sublimation technique, ensuring that the playful cat illustrations enveloping each key are resistant to fading and wear.";i:3;s:315:"【142 keys Set, Widely Compatible】This 142-key collection is the purr-fect blend of charm and quality, designed for those who demand both style and durability in their typing adventures. KiiBOOM Maorbeng Keycap set compatible with 60%, 65%, 75%, TKL (Tenkeyless), 96%, 1800-compact, and full-size ANSI keyboards.";i:4;s:312:"【MX-Clone Switch Compatibility】The KiiBOOM Maorbeng Keycap Set is designed with a MX Structure Stem, which is compatible with most mechanical keyboard switches, means that these keycaps are versatile and can be used with a wide range of switch brands and types, including Cherry MX, Gateron, Kailh, and more.";}s:8:"Warranty";s:15:"1 year warranty";s:5:"Color";s:10:"Meow Squad";s:16:"Is Adult Product";b:0;s:15:"Number Of Items";i:1;s:5:"Title";s:161:"KiiBoom x Maorbeng Meow Meow Squad Keycaps Set, Dye-Sublimation PBT, Mao Profile, 142 Keys Custom Keycaps for ANSI Layout, MX Switches Mechanical Gaming Keyboard";}s:5:"Title";s:161:"KiiBoom x Maorbeng Meow Meow Squad Keycaps Set, Dye-Sublimation PBT, Mao Profile, 142 Keys Custom Keycaps for ANSI Layout, MX Switches Mechanical Gaming Keyboard";s:3:"SKU";s:0:"";s:7:"Feature";a:5:{i:0;s:499:"【KiiBOOM x Maorbeng Keycaps Set】Step into a world where each keystroke is a symphony of cuteness with the KiiBOOM x Maorbeng Meow Meow Squad Keycaps Set! With compatibility across various keyboard sizes, this Keycaps Set is not just an accessory, but a centerpiece that transforms your keyboard into a delightful menagerie of keyboard. It's a must-have for enthusiasts who want to infuse their workspace with a dash of whimsy and a whisper of comfort, turning the mundane into the extraordinary.";i:1;s:467:"【Ergonomic MAO Profile】The unique MAO profile height introduces a novel typing experience, tailored for ergonomic comfort and aesthetic pleasure. Revel in a palette of soothing pastels, with each keycap featuring an adorable cat motif, from the whimsical expressions of playful kittens to serene and wise feline faces. The attention to detail is evident, as even the 'Enter' key is graced with a lounging cat, inviting you to pause and smile amidst your busy day.";i:2;s:248:"【Dye-Sublimation on PBT Material】KiiBOOM Maorbeng keycaps are constructed from top-tier PBT material using a five-sided dye-sublimation technique, ensuring that the playful cat illustrations enveloping each key are resistant to fading and wear.";i:3;s:315:"【142 keys Set, Widely Compatible】This 142-key collection is the purr-fect